MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Calendar page (/calendar + sidebar item): month grid + 30-day agenda of
  assignment/exam/rotation dates. Data = ~/Documents/Nemesis Library/School/
  calendar.json — the agent writes events as it reads Blackboard/Outlook
  (read-merge-write contract; agent events render read-only), student adds/
  edits/deletes manually without clobbering agent writes. Re-reads on focus.
- Study deck-file reconcile: deck .tsv files are now the source of truth.
  sourceFile on StudyDeck; pure reconcileDeckFiles (rename detection ≥50%
  card overlap keeps FSRS schedule through file renames; card matching by
  front+back preserves ids/schedule/tags; removed cards pruned; decks without
  sourceFile never touched). adoptLegacyDeckFiles one-time relink prevents
  duplication; failed scans return null so a read error can never wipe decks.
  Runs on mount + debounced window focus. 14 new unit tests (vitest, all pass).
- Library re-reads the vault on window focus (debounced) so agent-organized
  files show up without a manual reload.
- (Agent-side, outside this repo: nemesis-organize skill + SOUL capability
  lines + school-portal calendar read-merge-write rules — synced to the kit.)
